# Mailmap — canonical names for git shortlog / log --use-mailmap
# Keeps automation bots from appearing as human contributors.
# GitHub's Contributors graph still counts commit authors; this file only affects local `git shortlog`/`git log --use-mailmap`.

# Dependabot — map to neutral bot identity (keeps history intact, groups under one name)
Dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>

# GitHub Actions bot (future, if used)
github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>

